#NOTES for guidance:
# {t: Your Title } needed                               
# {artist: Performer} Optional  
# {st: Sub Title} Optional extra information - date etc.
# {key: } Needed if you want to try changing keys       
#  
# Standard web link Standard html link to clubsite or 
# Youtube etc - see format above - optional  
# {c: }  gives blank line e.g. between verses  
# blank line in songs also gives blank line!!!         
# {c: comment} put's indented comment on a line         
# {soc} start of chorus block - indents                 
#     {eoc} end of chorus block - end of indent         
# {sot} start of tab block                              
#     {eot} end of tab block                            
# {define:..}  - easiest way is to create chord using -      
{define: Csus2/E frets 0 0 0 5 fingers 0 0 0 0}
{define: Fsus2/A frets 0 0 1 0 fingers 0 0 0 0}
{define: Gsus2/B frets 2 2 3 2 fingers 1 1 2 1 add: string 3 fret 2 finger 1}
{define: Asus2/C# frets 4 4 5 4 fingers 1 1 2 1 add: string 3 fret 5 finger 1}
{define: E7#9 frets 0 4 4 5 fingers 0 0 0 0}
{define: E7-9 frets 6 4 4 8 fingers 0 0 0 0}
{define: F13 frets 2 2 1 3 fingers 0 0 0 0}
{define: G13 frets 0 2 0 5 fingers 0 0 0 0}
{define: Bb13 frets 1 2 3 1 fingers 1 2 3 1 add: string 2 fret 1 finger 1 add: string 3 fret 1 finger 1}
{define: G/A frets 2 2 0 2}

